# The raw disassembly corpus is regenerable from runtime-blobs/ and totals ~15 MB
# per blob (sh tools/st21-fw-loader-reproduce.sh rebuilds it in ~2 s, then deletes
# it unless --keep-asm): on disk, not in git.
analysis/st21-gemini-audit/audit/disasm/*.asm
# The small derived artifacts under audit/ — 5 tool-output files plus the 5
# per-function listings in audit/disasm/, ~250 KB — ARE tracked (root .gitignore):
# firmware-loader-rev2.md cites those paths, so "re-run the tool and diff me"
# has to be checkable offline, and byte-identity claims need a committed baseline.
__pycache__/
